    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Locusts, Fire and a Plumb Line",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "showed me: He was preparing swarms of locusts after the king's share had been harvested and just as the late crops were coming up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they had stripped the land clean, I cried out, \"Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", forgive! How can Jacob survive? He is so small!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "relented.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "AMO 7:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"This will not happen,\" the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "showed me: The Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was calling for judgment by fire; it dried up the great deep and devoured the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I cried out, \"Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I beg you, stop! How can Jacob survive? He is so small!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "relented.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "AMO 7:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"This will not happen either,\" the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what he showed me: The Lord was standing by a wall that had been built true to plumb,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "with a plumb line",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "in his hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asked me, \"What do you see, Amos?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "AMO 7:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"A plumb line,\" I replied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "AMO 7:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Then the Lord said, \"Look, I am setting a plumb line among my people Israel; I will spare them no longer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The high places of Isaac will be destroyed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 7:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and the sanctuaries of Israel will be ruined;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 7:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "with my sword I will rise against the house of Jeroboam.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amos and Amaziah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Amaziah the priest of Bethel sent a message to Jeroboam king of Israel: \"Amos is raising a conspiracy against you in the very heart of Israel. The land cannot bear all his words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this is what Amos is saying:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "AMO 7:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Jeroboam will die by the sword,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 7:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and Israel will surely go into exile,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "AMO 7:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "away from their native land.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Amaziah said to Amos, \"Get out, you seer! Go back to the land of Judah. Earn your bread there and do your prophesying there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't prophesy anymore at Bethel, because this is the king's sanctuary and the temple of the kingdom.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amos answered Amaziah, \"I was neither a prophet nor the son of a prophet, but I was a shepherd, and I also took care of sycamore-fig trees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "took me from tending the flock and said to me, 'Go, prophesy to my people Israel.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now then, hear the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.16"
                ]
              }
            }
